<title>UK: Ward family looking to sell stake.</title>
<headline>Ward family looking to sell stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>House building firm Ward Holdings Plc said on Monday that members of the Ward family representing shares of over 51 percent of its share capital are looking to sell their shares.</p>
<p>The Ward family has controlled the company since it was floated in 1972.</p>
<p>Ward said that trading in the six months to April 30, 1997 has shown a marked improvement compared with the year to October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
